    "## 3. SFT 数据构造策略\n",
    "\n",
    **数据来源**：\n",
    "- 官方文档（MySQL / PostgreSQL 官网）\n",
    "- 论文（索引优化、查询优化、执行计划）\n",
    "- StackOverflow 问题与回答\n",
    "- 真实生产问题（脱敏）\n",
    "\n",
    **数据格式**：\n",
    "```json\n",
    "{\n",
    "    \"messages\": [\n",
    "        {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"如何优化这个 SQL？\"},\n",
    "        {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"优化建议：1. 添加索引 2. 使用 EXPLAIN 分析执行计划 3. 避免全表扫描...\"}\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "}\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    **质量控制**：\n",
    "- 人工抽检 10%+ \n",
    "- 确保 chosen/rejected 清晰区分（如果做 DPO）\n",
    "- 涵盖多种场景（SELECT / JOIN / WHERE / GROUP BY / ORDER BY / 索引）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s3-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE：模拟 SFT 数据构造\n",
    "\n",
    "# 生成示例 SFT 数据\n",
    "sft_data = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"messages\": [\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"如何优化这个查询？SELECT * FROM users WHERE status = 1 ORDER BY created_at DESC;\"},\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"优化建议：1. 添加索引：CREATE INDEX idx_users_status_created ON users(status, created_at); 2. 避免 SELECT *，只查需要的列；3. 分页查询。\"}\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"messages\": [\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"为什么我的查询很慢？SELECT * FROM orders JOIN customers ON orders.customer_id = customers.id WHERE orders.order_date > '2024-01-01';\"},\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"性能问题分析：1. 缺少 JOIN 索引；2. 全表扫描 orders 表；3. order_date 没有索引。建议添加索引：CREATE INDEX idx_orders_customer_order_date ON orders(customer_id, order_date);\"}\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"messages\": [\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"MySQL EXPLAIN 结果怎么解读？\"},\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"EXPLAIN 结果解读：type = ALL 表示全表扫描，key = NULL 表示没用索引，rows = 100000 表示扫描 10 万行。优先优化 type 和 key。\"}\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"messages\": [\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"什么情况下索引失效？\"},\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"索引失效情况：1. 使用函数运算（WHERE YEAR(order_date) = 2024）；2. 隐式类型转换（WHERE order_id = '123'，order_id 是 int）；3. LIKE 前导通配符（WHERE name LIKE '%abc'）；4. OR 两边都有索引列。\"}\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"messages\": [\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"MySQL 的聚簇索引和非聚簇索引有什么区别？\"},\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"区别：聚簇索引就是主键索引，数据行按主键顺序存储；非聚簇索引（二级索引）存储索引值和主键，查询时需要回表。MyISAM 是非聚簇，InnoDB 是聚簇。\"}\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'共生成 {len(sft_data)} 条 SFT 数据（OFFLINE 模拟）')\n",
    "print('\\n示例数据 1（索引优化）：')\n",
    "print(json.dumps(sft_data[0], ensure_ascii=False))\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n示例数据 2（EXPLAIN 解读）：')\n",
    "print(json.dumps(sft_data[2], ensure_ascii=False))"
   ]
  },
